			"notes": "- Fixed replant feature occasionally failing to replant.\n- - Note that it is still really easy to break it yourself immediately after replanting, so it can still look like it failed.\n- Optimised the raycasting.\n- Now the #farm3x3:crops tag only includes crops that work with the data pack.\n- Raycasting steps are now stored per-player.\n- Now we check if the player is sneaking before starting a raycast or checking crop scores.\n- Addons will no longer break with minor version releases. All potentially breaking updates will be a major release."
		},
